\ A redefinition inside a word body whose declared effect mismatches the arity of the word it
\ redefines raises arity-mismatch with the framed rendering. Both definitions land in the body's
\ own transient frame, so the second is a same-scope redefinition of the first. The eager suite
\ reuses this golden, so passing both modes is the parity check.

make-stored: ( -- s ) [
  val: ( -- s ) [ "A" ] ;
  val: ( x y -- s ) [ 2drop "B" ] ;
  val
] ;

make-stored drop
